WEBVTT

00:01:43.040 --> 00:01:46.460
This feels... incredibly hot!

00:01:47.830 --> 00:01:49.290
I've turned red.

00:01:50.790 --> 00:01:52.460
Is this the complete form?

00:01:59.590 --> 00:02:01.260
It's like I'm not myself!

00:02:05.140 --> 00:02:06.430
We've lost him again!

00:02:06.430 --> 00:02:07.600
I'll look for him right away.

00:02:12.020 --> 00:02:13.610
This is quite the surprise.

00:02:14.280 --> 00:02:17.240
This is too different from any of the specs on Zet up until now.

00:02:17.650 --> 00:02:19.820
His specs, including speed and jumping,

00:02:19.820 --> 00:02:23.620
are overwhelmingly higher than any previous data.

00:02:28.540 --> 00:02:32.040
Episode 7: Ring of Exposure

00:02:36.590 --> 00:02:38.550
Could that be... Zet?!

00:02:52.860 --> 00:02:53.560
You bastard!

00:02:54.360 --> 00:02:57.150
How dare you kill my offspring!

00:02:57.610 --> 00:03:01.660
I'll bring ruin upon those who harm mankind.

00:03:01.660 --> 00:03:03.410
What're you going on about, you drunk?

00:03:03.950 --> 00:03:05.330
What the hell are you?

00:03:06.450 --> 00:03:07.700
I am justice...

00:03:08.250 --> 00:03:08.870
...whose name...

00:03:10.410 --> 00:03:11.250
...is Alphas!

00:03:11.250 --> 00:03:13.580
You're totally insane.

00:03:13.580 --> 00:03:17.550
I'll make you suffer the same fate as my offspring!

00:03:27.060 --> 00:03:33.060
Pretending to be a foolish human was unbearable!

00:03:34.730 --> 00:03:36.360
A monster?!

00:03:36.360 --> 00:03:39.490
I can't believe something like this really exists!

00:03:44.820 --> 00:03:46.450
Look!

00:03:47.080 --> 00:03:49.200
This is the real me!

00:03:49.750 --> 00:03:53.210
Like I could ever be killed by a foolish human!

00:03:53.580 --> 00:03:55.420
If a gun has no effect, then...

00:03:55.420 --> 00:03:57.040
Cutting Mode.

00:03:59.960 --> 00:04:01.800
Can you tell me your name?

00:04:02.300 --> 00:04:03.630
What for?

00:04:04.300 --> 00:04:08.640
So I can carve the names of the evil I
defeat into the gravestone of memory.

00:04:08.640 --> 00:04:12.810
You're getting carried away just because you defeated my offspring,

00:04:12.810 --> 00:04:14.690
you mere human.

00:04:14.690 --> 00:04:16.270
Know your place!

00:04:18.070 --> 00:04:19.690
Enforcing justice!

00:04:27.580 --> 00:04:31.040
I don't give a shit about Zet.

00:04:37.790 --> 00:04:41.550
This is all because I listened to what Haitani said.

00:04:42.010 --> 00:04:45.930
I'll do things my own way!

00:04:53.930 --> 00:04:55.230
What the hell?

00:04:55.230 --> 00:04:57.900
This is bad... I couldn't sense him at all!

00:04:58.400 --> 00:05:02.400
I see... That guy's Zet.

00:05:02.860 --> 00:05:04.650
I've found him!

00:05:08.740 --> 00:05:10.240
Perfect timing.

00:05:10.240 --> 00:05:13.540
I'll cut you into pieces before I go do that girl.

00:05:14.710 --> 00:05:20.340
Or maybe I'll fuck her right before your eyes.

00:05:20.340 --> 00:05:23.800
When I've had my fun, I'll kill both of you and devour you.

00:05:24.130 --> 00:05:26.430
You're not capable of that.

00:05:27.010 --> 00:05:29.390
Stop trying to be cool!

00:05:34.270 --> 00:05:35.850
Why am I reverting?!

00:05:37.230 --> 00:05:38.400
I can't stop it!

00:05:42.480 --> 00:05:44.150
The Ring of Exposure...

00:05:44.650 --> 00:05:46.240
What's going on?

00:05:46.240 --> 00:05:47.860
Why did I revert?

00:05:48.410 --> 00:05:50.370
Is this your fault?!

00:05:57.710 --> 00:05:58.620
Incredible!

00:05:59.540 --> 00:06:00.840
You...!

00:06:12.890 --> 00:06:15.100
I'll put an end to your life.

00:06:28.610 --> 00:06:31.450
You're peerless when you're red.

00:06:33.910 --> 00:06:34.830
Haitani!

00:06:36.870 --> 00:06:38.580
Is there someone else there?

00:06:38.870 --> 00:06:41.630
Just as I'd expect from the Ring of Awakening.

00:06:41.630 --> 00:06:45.340
It can force EVOL to revert from their human forms.

00:06:45.340 --> 00:06:46.920
What?!

00:06:46.920 --> 00:06:48.470
Why did you come here?

00:06:48.470 --> 00:06:51.800
Isono Shuu has broken the rules of EVOL.

00:06:51.800 --> 00:06:53.510
Hurry up and kill him for me.

00:06:53.510 --> 00:06:54.850
What did you say?!

00:06:55.760 --> 00:07:01.350
That guy's a real piece of work who takes
pleasure in killing humans and eating their flesh.

00:07:01.940 --> 00:07:04.940
I wonder how many people he's killed so far.

00:07:04.940 --> 00:07:09.240
He wants to rape and devour that girl in your room, too!

00:07:09.570 --> 00:07:11.490
What's the meaning of this, Haitani?!

00:07:11.490 --> 00:07:14.240
You're the one who told me to kill Zet!

00:07:14.700 --> 00:07:16.410
If I told you to kill him,

00:07:16.410 --> 00:07:19.370
you'd try to do it with all your might, wouldn't you?

00:07:19.370 --> 00:07:25.630
Thanks to that, I have a good understanding
of what's going on inside his body right now.

00:07:25.630 --> 00:07:29.760
I'd be happy with things just as long as he turned red.

00:07:29.760 --> 00:07:31.260
You tricked us?!

00:07:34.640 --> 00:07:36.470
Damn it!

00:07:38.140 --> 00:07:41.310
There's no need to listen to any more of this guy's blathering.

00:07:46.230 --> 00:07:48.570
I really don't get your sort of kindness.

00:07:49.070 --> 00:07:51.570
He's the type that can transfer himself
from his main body to one of his offspring...

00:07:51.570 --> 00:07:54.070
...when he's on the verge of death.

00:07:54.070 --> 00:07:56.830
I don't think he'll die from just that.

00:08:05.880 --> 00:08:07.800
Woah, amazing!

00:08:08.300 --> 00:08:10.800
This is overwhelming...

00:08:11.630 --> 00:08:14.050
The Zet factors are rising even further!

00:08:15.010 --> 00:08:18.560
I can't even imagine what will happen after this.

00:08:22.520 --> 00:08:23.640
Oh?

00:08:23.640 --> 00:08:26.190
Why do you look so sad?

00:08:27.060 --> 00:08:29.860
You used your own comrades?!

00:08:29.860 --> 00:08:33.070
Oh, you look down because of that?

00:08:33.070 --> 00:08:35.700
Like I thought, I really don't get your sort of kindness.

00:08:36.160 --> 00:08:37.780
What're you after?

00:08:37.780 --> 00:08:38.330
Tell me!

00:08:41.120 --> 00:08:46.210
I'm different from Isono-kun and others... A special EVOL!

00:08:46.210 --> 00:08:49.670
You'll get yourself in trouble if you think you can force me to revert...

00:08:49.670 --> 00:08:51.710
...like those low-level guys.

00:08:51.710 --> 00:08:52.840
Don't screw with me!

00:08:57.760 --> 00:08:59.680
Well, see you later.

00:09:05.770 --> 00:09:07.350
What's happening?

00:09:10.900 --> 00:09:13.240
There's no doubt about it, right?

00:09:15.700 --> 00:09:17.360
Red Zet...

00:09:19.450 --> 00:09:22.490
It looks like Isono-kun and the others have gone too far.

00:09:22.490 --> 00:09:24.040
Because of what happened tonight,

00:09:24.040 --> 00:09:27.370
the humans may learn about our existence.

00:09:28.880 --> 00:09:31.380
And you said that Haitani was there?

00:09:32.090 --> 00:09:34.340
Bring him here at once!

00:09:37.470 --> 00:09:40.930
As far as Konoha's condition goes, she's suffered severe blood loss,

00:09:40.930 --> 00:09:42.930
and we don't have enough packs for a blood transfusion!

00:09:42.930 --> 00:09:45.560
We're transporting her to Amagi Hospital.

00:09:46.230 --> 00:09:47.690
How's Konoha-kun's friend?

00:09:48.100 --> 00:09:51.190
She's shocked to the point where she can't speak.

00:09:51.190 --> 00:09:54.320
Got it! Please keep me informed.

00:09:54.320 --> 00:09:55.570
Understood.

00:09:56.570 --> 00:09:58.280
How're things with Kouga-kun?

00:09:58.280 --> 00:10:00.320
He's still fighting.

00:10:01.120 --> 00:10:03.830
The Alphas suit is connected with Kouga's consciousness,

00:10:03.830 --> 00:10:06.080
and it's maintaining high levels.

00:10:06.410 --> 00:10:09.210
But what does he mean by monsters?

00:10:09.630 --> 00:10:11.420
Whatever they are,

00:10:11.420 --> 00:10:16.470
I guess you could say it's fate that the Alphas suit got made.

00:10:16.920 --> 00:10:18.800
That's right, Ayami-san,

00:10:18.800 --> 00:10:21.640
should we tell Konoha-chan's parents about her condition...?

00:10:21.640 --> 00:10:23.350
I suppose we should inform them.

00:10:34.860 --> 00:10:36.440
What happened?

00:10:36.440 --> 00:10:38.450
There's damage to Alphas!

00:10:38.450 --> 00:10:43.200
When Kouga hesitates or feels lost, it has an effect on the suit.

00:10:48.210 --> 00:10:50.870
No matter what kind of dodgy outfit you wear,

00:10:51.290 --> 00:10:54.880
there's no way a human could rival us EVOL.

00:10:55.380 --> 00:10:57.380
I can't beat him through strength alone.

00:10:58.090 --> 00:10:59.760
He knows how to fight...

00:11:00.340 --> 00:11:03.010
...much more... than I do.

00:11:05.010 --> 00:11:08.890
Kouga-kun, Konoha was transferred to the air ambulance.

00:11:09.350 --> 00:11:11.350
Right now she's receiving emergency first-aid,

00:11:11.350 --> 00:11:13.900
and she'll be arriving at Amagi Hospital any moment now.

00:11:14.360 --> 00:11:16.150
You saved her!

00:11:17.780 --> 00:11:18.860
Thank you...

00:11:20.650 --> 00:11:21.410
That's right.

00:11:21.950 --> 00:11:23.320
I can't lose!

00:11:24.990 --> 00:11:28.080
I am Alphas!

00:11:29.960 --> 00:11:31.960
Functions are completely restored!

00:11:31.960 --> 00:11:33.500
All at once, amazing!

00:11:33.500 --> 00:11:35.920
The spirit of Alphas isn't dead!

00:11:35.920 --> 00:11:37.590
As long as Kouga-kun is strong,

00:11:38.010 --> 00:11:41.090
all the suit's functions will respond!

00:11:41.090 --> 00:11:42.470
Die!

00:11:49.850 --> 00:11:51.310
W-What are you?

00:11:51.600 --> 00:11:53.310
Get a hold of yourself...

00:11:54.150 --> 00:11:54.690
...Kouga.

00:11:55.190 --> 00:11:56.820
Why do you know my name?

00:11:58.820 --> 00:12:00.190
That ring...!

00:12:11.540 --> 00:12:12.990
It can't be...

00:12:15.170 --> 00:12:16.460
You surprised me.

00:12:19.460 --> 00:12:24.810
I could barely feel your presence until you got close, Zet!

00:12:24.810 --> 00:12:25.470
Zet?

00:12:41.650 --> 00:12:43.240
I'm killing these guys.

00:12:43.240 --> 00:12:44.700
Lend me your strength.

00:12:44.700 --> 00:12:45.990
Right.

00:12:48.910 --> 00:12:54.710
This guy has the ability to survive by
transferring himself into these little shrimp guys.

00:12:54.710 --> 00:12:58.340
If we don't take them all out at once, there'll be no end to it.

00:13:11.470 --> 00:13:14.140
Zet, did you meet Shuu?

00:13:14.140 --> 00:13:16.940
If you're talking about that roach guy, I took care of him earlier.

00:13:16.940 --> 00:13:19.560
You aren't going to scare me.

00:13:19.560 --> 00:13:22.150
I really don't care about what happened to him.

00:13:22.690 --> 00:13:24.280
I bet!

00:13:24.860 --> 00:13:27.160
You're the worst, Zet.

00:13:27.160 --> 00:13:29.530
Why ally yourself with the humans?

00:13:29.920 --> 00:13:32.700
Why do you guys attack humans?

00:13:32.700 --> 00:13:35.660
Don't you think it's strange?

00:13:35.660 --> 00:13:39.250
We were created at the whim of humans to fight,

00:13:39.250 --> 00:13:42.050
and we're going to be destroyed by another whim of theirs.

00:13:42.050 --> 00:13:44.170
That's the tragedy of us EVOL.

00:13:44.760 --> 00:13:46.170
You're the same!

00:13:46.800 --> 00:13:49.470
You were created to hunt us.

00:13:49.470 --> 00:13:51.510
You were even given a heart,

00:13:51.510 --> 00:13:57.560
but you're forced to ignore it and are used by the humans.

00:13:58.060 --> 00:14:01.110
That's nothing different than being a slave!

00:14:01.110 --> 00:14:04.820
Unfortunately, I've never thought of myself as a slave.

00:14:05.320 --> 00:14:08.360
I'll hunt you down with my own will.

00:14:09.740 --> 00:14:13.080
And if that's the case, I'll kill humans with my own will!

00:14:13.370 --> 00:14:16.200
I'll kill you for allying with them!

00:14:49.780 --> 00:14:51.370
What's happening?

00:14:51.370 --> 00:14:53.660
My body's getting hot again...

00:15:27.690 --> 00:15:28.900
Huh?

00:15:29.640 --> 00:15:31.410
He turned white?

00:15:34.200 --> 00:15:36.490
Doctor, what is this?!

00:15:36.490 --> 00:15:37.540
I don't know.

00:15:37.540 --> 00:15:41.830
Furthermore, normally he'd be disintegrating with numbers like these!

00:15:41.830 --> 00:15:43.170
It's beyond my understanding!

00:15:48.550 --> 00:15:49.670
Die!

00:15:58.010 --> 00:15:59.100
It's started.

00:15:59.720 --> 00:16:03.100
The shrimp guy is a pretty even match fighting the two of them.

00:16:03.560 --> 00:16:04.900
I see.

00:16:08.570 --> 00:16:09.610
Tomomi-san?

00:16:18.950 --> 00:16:21.870
It's fine... You're safe now!

00:16:26.920 --> 00:16:28.880
Um, she... She went to return this.

00:16:29.840 --> 00:16:31.590
That's Konoha's?

00:16:31.590 --> 00:16:32.880
It's weird, isn't it?

00:16:33.930 --> 00:16:36.340
Even though he's not in a place like this anymore,

00:16:36.340 --> 00:16:37.890
I look for him without even thinking.

00:16:39.180 --> 00:16:41.640
The kid who patrolled with Kouga, right?

00:16:41.640 --> 00:16:45.650
I heard that he found his parents, and they took him in.

00:16:45.650 --> 00:16:49.360
But I have a feeling we'll meet again...

00:16:49.360 --> 00:16:50.400
Look!

00:16:51.650 --> 00:16:54.110
This is something he dropped.

00:16:54.110 --> 00:16:56.570
I think we'll definitely meet again.

00:16:56.570 --> 00:16:58.830
You don't have any contact information for him?

00:16:58.830 --> 00:16:59.780
Right.

00:17:00.330 --> 00:17:01.790
You've fallen for him!

00:17:02.290 --> 00:17:04.250
It's not like that!

00:17:04.250 --> 00:17:06.540
He might be in trouble without this.

00:17:06.920 --> 00:17:09.880
Yes, I hope you can meet him.

00:17:09.880 --> 00:17:10.710
Yeah!

00:17:31.020 --> 00:17:33.440
Stubborn, aren't you?

00:17:33.440 --> 00:17:35.990
Hey, shrimpy...

00:17:35.990 --> 00:17:38.700
You're just being used by Haitani.

00:17:38.700 --> 00:17:40.450
So what?

00:17:40.450 --> 00:17:42.580
You don't understand how good it feels...

00:17:42.580 --> 00:17:46.500
...to be able to kill without having to worry about the Sweeper.

00:17:47.080 --> 00:17:49.000
You're pitiful...

00:17:51.500 --> 00:17:52.170
You bastard!

00:18:09.900 --> 00:18:11.940
Let's crush them all at once!

00:18:17.740 --> 00:18:19.280
Shooting Mode.

00:18:23.450 --> 00:18:24.540
Just...

00:18:24.540 --> 00:18:24.910
Four more!

00:18:27.120 --> 00:18:27.500
Three!

00:18:29.460 --> 00:18:30.210
Two!

00:18:32.290 --> 00:18:33.420
One!

00:18:34.710 --> 00:18:35.960
Zet...

00:18:36.670 --> 00:18:43.180
I wonder if you'll feel good killing me.

00:18:43.180 --> 00:18:45.680
Die at ease.

00:18:46.100 --> 00:18:47.310
Zero!

00:19:04.370 --> 00:19:06.240
What about the Zet factors?

00:19:06.240 --> 00:19:10.620
They stopped rising with the Player's death.

00:19:11.250 --> 00:19:12.380
But...

00:19:12.790 --> 00:19:14.380
They're not going down.

00:19:14.380 --> 00:19:16.380
Then, he can't turn back into Jin?

00:19:18.550 --> 00:19:19.760
And the fight?

00:19:20.430 --> 00:19:22.260
It looks like it's over.

00:19:22.970 --> 00:19:26.310
Zet really stinks of humans.

00:19:26.310 --> 00:19:27.600
By which you mean?

00:19:27.600 --> 00:19:30.600
He sympathized with Isono-kun and the others.

00:19:30.600 --> 00:19:33.400
He said he felt sorry for them being used by me.

00:19:33.860 --> 00:19:37.110
He has a nature worthy of being the Charisma.

00:19:37.110 --> 00:19:39.650
He has both strength and kindness.

00:19:39.650 --> 00:19:44.280
But sooner or later he's going to realise his destiny.

00:19:44.280 --> 00:19:48.410
It seems like there are a lot of ways we can use that cosplaying Amagi kid, too.

00:19:49.000 --> 00:19:51.670
Ichirou-kun, you get along with him, too, OK?

00:19:52.120 --> 00:19:55.540
I like Kouga-kun.

00:20:18.110 --> 00:20:19.190
Jin!

00:20:25.120 --> 00:20:25.990
Jin!

00:20:27.160 --> 00:20:28.790
I thought it was you...

00:20:29.910 --> 00:20:32.290
It's... been a while!

00:20:33.040 --> 00:20:35.670
I remembered how things used to be.

00:20:35.670 --> 00:20:38.920
How we used to chase after evil together.

00:20:38.920 --> 00:20:39.800
Me, too.

00:20:40.590 --> 00:20:46.470
Have you been... battling those guys... all alone?

00:20:47.510 --> 00:20:50.220
You're creeping me out.

00:20:51.350 --> 00:20:53.770
The real deal is here in my arms...

00:20:54.690 --> 00:20:58.150
A hero who can transform!

00:21:01.280 --> 00:21:02.190
Kouga?!

00:21:04.110 --> 00:21:06.570
Even after he's turned back into Jin, the numbers aren't changing!

00:21:24.090 --> 00:21:25.260
Tanaka!

00:21:30.180 --> 00:21:32.270
Are you OK? Hey!

00:21:33.680 --> 00:21:36.730
You said the monsters were about to attack her.

00:21:36.730 --> 00:21:40.150
Did they all get taken out when you defeated the main body?

00:21:40.150 --> 00:21:42.400
It could've been the Sweeper.

00:21:42.400 --> 00:21:43.740
Sweeper?

00:21:45.070 --> 00:21:45.900
Are you waking up?

00:21:48.740 --> 00:21:49.870
Jin?

00:21:49.870 --> 00:21:51.660
Yeah, it's me.

00:21:52.540 --> 00:21:54.500
You're late, stupid!

00:21:54.500 --> 00:21:57.170
Sorry I'm late...

00:22:10.260 --> 00:22:16.230
Your birthday comes,

00:22:16.230 --> 00:22:23.070
and I pick a present for you.

00:22:23.070 --> 00:22:29.320
I stop my feet on fifth street.

00:22:29.320 --> 00:22:36.000
This love can't be changed.

00:22:38.580 --> 00:22:45.550
Darling, stop the clock, stop your head,

00:22:45.550 --> 00:22:51.390
stop your heart, your eyes and ears, and everything.

00:22:51.390 --> 00:22:58.230
Darling, all the words I received from you.

00:22:58.230 --> 00:23:09.650
Hugging you as if embracing a rose with no thorns.

00:23:09.650 --> 00:23:17.290
Darling, the miracle of the two of us meeting in this world.

00:23:17.290 --> 00:23:28.720
With only a trace of that, me loving you.

00:23:36.240 --> 00:23:38.990
When I come back home, want to be a family?

00:23:38.990 --> 00:23:39.830
Huh?!

00:23:39.830 --> 00:23:40.480
Hang on a sec!

00:23:41.280 --> 00:23:42.680
What is this?!

00:23:42.680 --> 00:23:44.950
Tomorrow's too late...
